    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You master new ways to use your telekinetic abilities.</p><p><strong>Psi-Powered Leap.</strong> As a Bonus Action, you gain a Fly Speed equal to twice your Speed until the end of the current turn. Once you take this Bonus Action, you can't do so again until you finish a Short or Long Rest, unless you expend a Psionic Energy Die (no action required) to restore it.</p><p><strong>Telekinetic Thrust.</strong> When you deal damage to a target with your Psionic Strike, you can force it to make a Strength saving throw (DC 8 plus your Intelligence modifier and Proficiency Bonus). On a failure, you can give it the Prone condition or move it up to 10 feet horizontally.</p>",
